      "pubkey": "dW50cnVzdGVkIGNvbW1lbnQ6IG1pbmlzaWduIHB1YmxpYyBrZXk6IDNBODkyOTQ0REVDNzE4MUUKUldRZUdNZmVSQ21KT2s0cnk3dXNTSm5FUGxoYWgxQVVBYW9rU1pHSnp4OWZlVFhjTVZEUXB6RGQK",
      "endpoints": [
        "https://github.com/Sword094/BrawlClient/releases/latest/download/latest.json"
      ]
    }
  }
}
